{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09405","headline":"新理西斋 · 韦应物","name":"新理西斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"方将甿讼理，久翳西斋居。\n草木无行次，闲暇一芟除。\n春阳土脉起，膏泽发生初。\n养条刊朽枿，护药锄秽芜。\n稍稍觉林耸，历历忻竹疎。\n始见庭宇旷，顿令烦抱舒。\n兹焉即可爱，何必是吾庐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09405.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09405","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}